   "text": "1,000 consumers hit one database that restarts at t = 0. No jitter, base 1 s, doubling: every client computes the SAME retry times.",
   "originalText": "1,000 consumers hit one database that restarts at t = 0. No jitter, base 1 s, doubling: every client computes the SAME retry times.",
   "fontSize": 28,
   "fontFamily": 5,
