   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Same 1,000 retries. Worst 100 ms bucket: 1,000  vs  211  (equal)  vs  108  (full). Spread over 0.5 s that is about 2,000 requests/s arriving\nsmoothly instead of 1,000 in one instant.",
   "originalText": "Same 1,000 retries. Worst 100 ms bucket: 1,000  vs  211  (equal)  vs  108  (full). Spread over 0.5 s that is about 2,000 requests/s arriving\nsmoothly instead of 1,000 in one instant.",
