   "text": "AWS Architecture Blog (exponential backoff and jitter): jitter cut BOTH total completion time and total calls;",
   "originalText": "AWS Architecture Blog (exponential backoff and jitter): jitter cut BOTH total completion time and total calls;",
   "fontSize": 27,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "t00973",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 96,
   "y": 12324.5,
   "width": 1547.28,
