   "text": "cap(n) = min(max, base * 2^(n-1)). Shown at base 100 ms, attempt 5, so cap = 1600 ms. The coloured bar = where the delay can land.",
   "originalText": "cap(n) = min(max, base * 2^(n-1)). Shown at base 100 ms, attempt 5, so cap = 1600 ms. The coloured bar = where the delay can land.",
   "fontSize": 28,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
