   "text": "Protects against: retrying a record that keeps failing for its own reasons.\n\nAlone it fails: a long backoff with few attempts can run for minutes; a short\nbackoff with many attempts burns out within a second.",
   "originalText": "Protects against: retrying a record that keeps failing for its own reasons.\n\nAlone it fails: a long backoff with few attempts can run for minutes; a short\nbackoff with many attempts burns out within a second.",
