   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Protects against: running past what the caller tolerates (poll interval, HTTP\ntimeout, rebalance timeout).\n\nAlone it fails: short cheap retries may be dropped too early; no limit on wasted\nattempts.",
   "originalText": "Protects against: running past what the caller tolerates (poll interval, HTTP\ntimeout, rebalance timeout).\n\nAlone it fails: short cheap retries may be dropped too early; no limit on wasted\nattempts.",
