   "text": "Sink version: 6 partitions all hit ONE Postgres. With 3 sink pods draining chunks of 1,000 rows, a restart produces dozens of simultaneous\nconnection attempts per second. Backoff + jitter + PAUSING the partition (not spinning) keeps it bounded.",
